OL,3,GNEWSAMercury fringe shows to spotlight
OL,4,Aupcoming artists
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of fringe events in the run-up
OL,7,Fto the Mercury Prize's second year in
OL,8,FNewcastle will showcase upcoming
OL,9,Fmusicians, organisers say.
OL,11,FThe city will see live performances,
OL,12,Flistening parties, screenings,
OL,13,Fworkshops and talks from 15 to 22
OL,14,FOctober, featuring artists from across
OL,15,Fnorth-east England.
OL,17,FA live edition of BBC Introducing will
OL,18,Fcome from The Glasshouse International
OL,19,FCentre for Music, headlined by
OL,20,FSunderland's Tom A. Smith.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
