OL,3,GNEWSAMercury fringe shows to spotlight
OL,4,Aupcoming artists
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresenter Neave Farry, from Ferryhill,
OL,7,Fis curating and hosting a free acoustic
OL,8,Fevent at the Grainger Market and said
OL,9,Fthe "rest of England is waking up to
OL,10,Fthe beautiful scene that we've got in
OL,11,Fthe North East".
